{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "A.M.C.A.: Monitor",
    "steam_appid": 3459900,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459900/extras/6da681915fdb6600d415928f8eee1d98.poster.avif?t=1741942962\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459900/extras/6da681915fdb6600d415928f8eee1d98.webp?t=1741942962\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=213 /></picture></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an agent working for the <strong>A.M.C.A.</strong>, you're tasked with <strong>monitoring</strong> places where unusual occurrences have been previously reported and report any abnormalities you spot on the cameras, as well as dealing with any entities that are deemed threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be sent to various locations, each with no less than 8 cameras to pay attention to, with more threats being introduced as you progress, until you finally reach <strong>where it all began</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shift lasts for 6 hours, from 12AM to 6AM (<strong>15 real life minutes</strong>), you must stay on edge throughout all 6 of these hours, otherwise, <strong>you'll face the consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure to report all active anomalies will result in a <strong>75%</strong> dock from your payment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No breaks, and good luck, you'll need it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Finding and reporting anomalies using the cams.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Multiple threats</strong> on and off the cameras.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>8</strong> <strong>Levels</strong> (<strong>5 </strong>on release).\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Challenges</strong> for each level.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Possibly a custom night for the final level.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTES\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor is inspired by <strong>I'm on Observation Duty</strong> and <strong>Five Nights at Freddy's</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor will release with 5 levels only and will update over time, 1-2 levels each update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm making this game <strong><i>completely </i></strong>solo.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is my first release, I'm open for criticism.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459900/extras/6da681915fdb6600d415928f8eee1d98.poster.avif?t=1741942962\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459900/extras/6da681915fdb6600d415928f8eee1d98.webp?t=1741942962\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=213 /></picture></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an agent working for the <strong>A.M.C.A.</strong>, you're tasked with <strong>monitoring</strong> places where unusual occurrences have been previously reported and report any abnormalities you spot on the cameras, as well as dealing with any entities that are deemed threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be sent to various locations, each with no less than 8 cameras to pay attention to, with more threats being introduced as you progress, until you finally reach <strong>where it all began</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shift lasts for 6 hours, from 12AM to 6AM (<strong>15 real life minutes</strong>), you must stay on edge throughout all 6 of these hours, otherwise, <strong>you'll face the consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure to report all active anomalies will result in a <strong>75%</strong> dock from your payment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No breaks, and good luck, you'll need it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Finding and reporting anomalies using the cams.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Multiple threats</strong> on and off the cameras.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>8</strong> <strong>Levels</strong> (<strong>5 </strong>on release).\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Challenges</strong> for each level.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Possibly a custom night for the final level.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTES\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor is inspired by <strong>I'm on Observation Duty</strong> and <strong>Five Nights at Freddy's</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor will release with 5 levels only and will update over time, 1-2 levels each update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm making this game <strong><i>completely </i></strong>solo.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is my first release, I'm open for criticism.</p>",
    "short_description": "A survival horror game where you defend yourself from threats while looking out for anomalies.",
